  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d4ea25a20425e7bd2b6b790061d728b2e68dee6e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d4ea25a20425e7bd2b6b790061d728b2e68dee6e\" data-origin-width=\"4284\" data-origin-height=\"5712\"></div><p>이번에 수행평가로 직병렬 실험하려고 합니다.&#160;</p><p>그래서 키트를 구입하여 모의실험중인데, 전류계는 직렬, 전압계는 병렬연결 하였는데</p><p>바늘이 모두 반대로 움직이는 모습이 보이네요/...</p><p>&#160;</p><p>왜그런지 알려주세요.ㅜㅠㅠ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>빨간은 빨강에 검정은 검정에 했거든요,,,</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv7t549ykd0yreb5t2eue5dcj@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1080\" data-video-height=\"1920\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv7t549ykd0yreb5t2eue5dcj/thumbs/3.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33333506627&amp;signature=brwJDG20wAOw0K%2Ft0amRgBnfjao%3D&amp;ts=1776597827\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1080\" data-video-origin-height=\"1920\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv7t549ykd0yreb5t2eue5dcj?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2N3Q1NDl5a2QweXJlYjV0MmV1ZTVkY2oiLCJ0aWQiOiIzMGZmYmY5Yy00NTVhLTQyMTUtYTg0ZC02MjU3YmZkNDcyZTMiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxOTAwNTJ9.ub4t5Pd773qbwjQrCVXGNYkS3Fgxk8lXpzldUQRapOCA7D31n-GdFcr3ZzbY-knxdz1xyZqjeEXXBvqmUm67FQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
